  "extraction_notes": [
    "PNP signed quantities retain the negative polarity shown in the datasheet; hFE is dimensionless and positive.",
    "All curve points are direct readings from plotted traces on p. 3 and are not interpolated.",
    "Fig. 1 contains ten output-characteristic traces for IB=-40, -80, -120, -160, -200, -240, -280, -320, -360, and -400 uA at TA=25 degC.",
    "The electrical table gives hFE1=120 minimum and 400 maximum at IC=-50 mA, VCE=-1 V, plus hFE2=50 minimum at IC=-500 mA, VCE=-1 V.",
    "The hFE classification table lists ranks L=120-200, H=200-350, and J=300-400.",
    "Only one VCE(sat)/VBE(sat) table row is published, at IC=-500 mA and IB=-50 mA.",
    "Cobo and Cibo have no tabulated electrical-characteristics values; their bias-dependent curves are available in Fig. 3.",
    "The maximum ratings list VCEO=-25 V, VCBO=-40 V, VEBO=-5 V, IC=-0.5 A continuous, and PC=0.3 W at TA=25 degC.",
    "The transition-frequency table value is a minimum of 150 MHz at VCE=-6 V and IC=-20 mA with the measurement frequency stated as 30 MHz; Fig. 8 is a typical curve at VCE=-6 V and TA=25 degC."
  ],
